flowchart LR
 UI[Role-specific Next.js UI] --> A[Authorized server action or route]
 A --> DB[Supabase Postgres constraints and transactions]
 A --> ST[Private Storage and signed URLs]
 A --> PAY[Hosted payment processor]
 A --> MSG[Twilio and Resend]
 A --> MAP[Google Maps and Directions]
 PAY --> WH[Verified deduplicated webhook]
 MSG --> DR[Delivery receipt]
 WH --> DB
 DR --> DB
 DB --> V[Role-safe view model]
 V --> UI
